Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: retain native hardware flow context and paths

Retain the original two native forward paths only for hardware-requesting
flowtables. Preserve independently referenced devices and routes beyond the
native flow lifetime, with owner-side semantic validation and no rerouting.
Pass the existing rule pair and live native identities through the existing
block callbacks, preserving directional dispatch and accounting full-width
hardware deltas without narrowing them at the conntrack boundary.

Signed-off-by: Codex

